<div class="container-fluid my-5 faq-section mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion justify-content-center mx-auto" id="vellumFaqAccordion" style="max-width: 950px;">
        
        <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow rounded-4">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeadingOne">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold text-dark rounded-4 " type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapseOne" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapseOne">
                    Is it possible to download videos from private accounts?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeadingOne" data-bs-parent="#vellumFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-dark large ">
                    Vellum Media Saver does not allow you to scrape or 
                    parse media from private profiles or locked accounts. 
                    Please ensure you are copying links from public posts 
                    and that you are not infringing on copyright or content creator guidelines.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow rounded-4">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeadingTwo">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold text-dark rounded-4" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapseTwo">
                    Does Vellum Media Saver have any download limits?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeadingTwo" data-bs-parent="#vellumFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-dark large">
                    Absolutely not! You can process and extract video strings or high-quality audio files as many times as you like. There are no throttles or daily caps on analysis processing.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion-item mb-3 border-0 shadow rounded-4">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faqHeadingThree">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold text-dark rounded-4" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faqCollapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faqCollapseThree">
                    What formats are supported for extraction?
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faqCollapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="faqHeadingThree" data-bs-parent="#vellumFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-dark large">
                    Currently, the engine extracts the highest available 
                    presentation streams directly into standard **MP4 Video** 
                    formats or packages the audio track standalone into crystal clear **MP3 Audio** containers.
                </div>
            </div>
